    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Starting at 13th level, during a short or long rest, you can tend to your allies' ailments. Choose a number of creatures up to your Intelligence modifier (minimum 1) that you can tend to during the rest. Those creatures are cured of one disease or one condition afflicting them (your choice). The condition can be blinded, deafened, paralyzed, or poisoned.</p>",
